            unit: "u_15",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Surprise! Die, you sun-lovers!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Now we are surrounded! Do you still want to fight us, Li’sar? Surely that would lead to doom for us all!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("I see we have little choice but to help each other. Let us fight together until we return to the surface. Agreed?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Very well, I promise that you will reach the surface again, or we shall all perish together."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("But once we escape from this hole, I have a score to settle with you!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Well, we have helped each other survive so far. Now let’s continue together. What do you say?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Yes. We agreed to help each other get out of these pits alive, did we not? Let us continue to pool our resources. I pledge to you my gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Thank you. Come, men. Let us find the Sceptre!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
